# 17. IMPROVEMENT LOOP

Implement:

async function improveAgent(agent, testResults) {

```
const failures = analyzeFailures(testResults);

if (failures.length === 0) {
    return agent;
}

const improvements =
    await generateImprovements(agent, failures);

const improvedAgent =
    await createNewVersion(agent, improvements);

return improvedAgent;
```

}

Then:

V1
↓
Test
↓
Failures
↓
Analyze
↓
Optimize
↓
V2
↓
Test
↓
Compare

Continue for a limited number of iterations, such as:

MAX_ITERATIONS = 3

Do NOT create infinite loops.

